  "description": "TeXmacs was my best kept secret for writing math homework and papers.",
  "body_html": "<a class=\"image-link image2\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Zt7O!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbda3a56e-9326-4889-b5e8-930e9854232d_799x685.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Zt7O!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbda3a56e-9326-4889-b5e8-930e9854232d_799x685.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Zt7O!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbda3a56e-9326-4889-b5e8-930e9854232d_799x685.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Zt7O!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbda3a56e-9326-4889-b5e8-930e9854232d_799x685.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Zt7O!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbda3a56e-9326-4889-b5e8-930e9854232d_799x685.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Zt7O!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbda3a56e-9326-4889-b5e8-930e9854232d_799x685.png\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://bucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/bda3a56e-9326-4889-b5e8-930e9854232d_799x685.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:null,&quot;width&quot;:null,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:null,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;screenshot of TeXmacs&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:null,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" title=\"screenshot of TeXmacs\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Zt7O!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbda3a56e-9326-4889-b5e8-930e9854232d_799x685.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Zt7O!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbda3a56e-9326-4889-b5e8-930e9854232d_799x685.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Zt7O!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbda3a56e-9326-4889-b5e8-930e9854232d_799x685.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Zt7O!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbda3a56e-9326-4889-b5e8-930e9854232d_799x685.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div></div></div></a><p><a href=\"http://texmacs.org\">TeXmacs</a>&nbsp;was my best kept secret for writing math homework and papers. It is a state-of-the-art typesetting system. Many people think that it is a \"front end\" of TeX/LaTeX (similar to&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.lyx.org/\">LyX</a>), but actually TeXmacs is&nbsp;independent of TeX and fundamentally better than TeX. TeXmacs&nbsp;inherited some good designs of TeX, but then went far beyond.</p><p>TeXmacs&nbsp;has the same or even better typographical quality than TeX but with much more intuitive and beautifully designed interface.&nbsp;The editor environment is 100% WYSIWYG. That means, the screen shows <em>exactly</em> what you would print out on paper. As of today, I don't know of any other typesetting system or word processor&nbsp;(including MS Word) that can achieve&nbsp;this. It&nbsp;is also WYTIWYG (What You <em>Think</em> Is What You Get).&nbsp;With all the beauty, you still have&nbsp;detailed control of document structure. The UI and controls are also intuitive and well-designed. You may&nbsp;sense the notion of \"<a href=\"http://www.amazon.com/Design-Everyday-Things-Revised-Expanded-ebook/dp/B00E257T6C\">human centered design</a>\" in it.</p><p>Over the years, I have accumulated lots of useful knowledge regarding its use and have collected them into a <a href=\"http://www.mindomo.com/view?m=b207992c90c046bdbe4053cbdf88b5d5\">mind map</a>. Click on the following image and you can see my best tricks with this software.</p><p>Have fun!</p><a class=\"image-link image2\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!L6MA!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F26353a8e-7afa-42f8-8c22-84c1b6a57738_635x423.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!L6MA!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F26353a8e-7afa-42f8-8c22-84c1b6a57738_635x423.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!L6MA!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F26353a8e-7afa-42f8-8c22-84c1b6a57738_635x423.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!L6MA!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F26353a8e-7afa-42f8-8c22-84c1b6a57738_635x423.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!L6MA!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F26353a8e-7afa-42f8-8c22-84c1b6a57738_635x423.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!L6MA!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F26353a8e-7afa-42f8-8c22-84c1b6a57738_635x423.png\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://bucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/26353a8e-7afa-42f8-8c22-84c1b6a57738_635x423.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:null,&quot;width&quot;:null,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:null,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:null,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!L6MA!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F26353a8e-7afa-42f8-8c22-84c1b6a57738_635x423.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!L6MA!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F26353a8e-7afa-42f8-8c22-84c1b6a57738_635x423.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!L6MA!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F26353a8e-7afa-42f8-8c22-84c1b6a57738_635x423.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!L6MA!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F26353a8e-7afa-42f8-8c22-84c1b6a57738_635x423.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"></picture><div></div></div></a>",
